{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1082242-hedge-ghosts","id":1082242,"title":"Hedge Ghosts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-22T07:04:53-07:00","id":1082242,"title":"Hedge Ghosts","content":"I just thought that a focused thread on this topic would be interesting and good for asking questions.<br /> <br /> Like what is the unifying theme of Hedge Ghosts given that they can have very different origins?<br /> <br /> Like they can be made from bits of soul called icons or intense emotions or people/goblins dying, and who knows what else? <br /> <br /> Can dreams produce Hedge Ghosts?<br /> <br /> Can Hedge Ghosts leave the Hedge to visit Arcadia, Dreams, or Ironside, and if they do, do they bleed glamour?<br /> <br /> How do they harvest Glamour, like Changeling via emotions, dreams, and hedge bounty? Weirder ways?<br /> <br /> Can they use the Claimed Manifestation? do Hedge Claimed count as Goblins?<br /> <br /> Do Changelings gain any ablity to create/summon/control Hedge Ghosts on purpose?<br /> <br /> Do Hedge Ghosts have any relation to Underworld Ghosts or Goetics?<br /> <br /> Can Hedge Ghosts steal Glamour from other Fae like underworld Ghosts can steal essence from other underworld ghosts and spirits can steal from other spirits?<br /> <br /> Will their be a retainer feat for Changeling Characters who want a Hedge Ghost pet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T11:11:19-07:00","id":1084586,"title":"","content":"I'm surprised no one has anything to add to this thread, am I the only one curious about Hedge Ghosts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T11:26:32-07:00","id":1084594,"title":"","content":"I think we need more material before really looking at them. Sure, we can speculate, I guess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T12:11:50-07:00","id":1084622,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1082242-hedge-ghosts?p=1084594#post1084594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think we need more material before really looking at them. Sure, we can speculate, I guess.</div> </div> </div> </div> Speculation can be fun. <br /> <br /> I'll start. There will be a drain numena that drains either willpower or glamour, instead willpower or essence like regular one. <br /> <br /> Hedge Ghosts will bleed glamour outside the hedge. <br /> <br /> Spirits and normal ghosts will slowly transform into Hedge Ghost if stuck in the Hedge too long. <br /> <br /> Hedge Ghosts will be able to harvest glamour from emotions like a Changeling. <br /> <br /> Hedge Ghosts will not have influences or the Claim Manifestation, but might have a Goblin Manifestation or Numina. <br /> <br /> Universal Seeker numena. <br /> <br /> Cause Bedlam Numina. <br /> <br /> A pledge Numina. <br /> <br /> Rank instead of Wyrd.<br /> <br /> Will get access to fetter and regular possession numena. <br /> <br /> Some kind of Dream Numina. <br /> <br /> Will replace Incubi and Succubi Oniero as dream creatures. <br /> <br /> Will be summonable/creatable via a contract. <br /> <br /> They won't be able to go above Rank 5, or if they can they Rank 6+ will be special some how, something even the Gentery don't like or at least respect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T12:34:43-07:00","id":1084635,"title":"","content":"Regular Ghost and Chthonian Ranks are:<br /> <br /> 0: Plasm<br /> 1: Mane<br /> 2-3: Lemures<br /> 4-5: Lares<br /> 6+ : Korobori<br /> <br /> I wonder what ranks Hedge Ghosts have and how similar the realitive complexity denoted by ranks will be to Underwood Ghosts will be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T13:19:19-07:00","id":1084664,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1082242-hedge-ghosts?p=1084635#post1084635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Regular Ghost and Chthonian Ranks are:<br /> <br /> 0: Plasm<br /> 1: Mane<br /> 2-3: Lemures<br /> 4-5: Lares<br /> 6+ : Korobori<br /> <br /> I wonder what ranks Hedge Ghosts have and how similar the realitive complexity denoted by ranks will be to Underwood Ghosts will be.</div> </div> </div> </div>I just want to point out that the list from the Mage core book isn't completely accurate. For example, Kerberoi are Rank 5+.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T17:19:59-07:00","id":1084771,"title":"","content":"So a Ghost can be both a Lares and a Kerberoi?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T18:30:53-07:00","id":1084804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1082242-hedge-ghosts?p=1084771#post1084771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So a Ghost can be both a Lares and a Kerberoi?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think Lares are distinct things, just a Mage categorization term.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T19:08:52-07:00","id":1084812,"title":"","content":"Manes, Lemures and Lares are just labels slapped on ghosts with no other qualifier than having to be a certain Rank. Mages are known to want to slap labels on everything, and it would make sense in case mages themselves don't use the term &quot;rank&quot; while discussing ghosts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T20:17:11-07:00","id":1084834,"title":"","content":"I'm still curious about what terms they use for Hedge Ghosts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T20:43:23-07:00","id":1084845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1082242-hedge-ghosts?p=1084834#post1084834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm still curious about what terms they use for Hedge Ghosts.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Whatever the individual Mage feels like? Hedge Ghosts would be far less common than normal Ghosts, and thus there might not be a unified terminology for them. Many Mages probably don't even know they <i>exist</i>.<br /> <br /> And this is of course presuming Mages themselves exist. Hedge Ghosts are Changeling, so Awakened existing is an optional element.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-28T07:38:09-07:00","id":1085020,"title":"","content":"How do we know Hedge Ghosts are less common? <br /> <br /> And it's possible Changelings would name them if the ranks represent a significant enough difference in nature and caoablities as they do in regular ghosts and even spirits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T07:37:54-07:00","id":1085451,"title":"","content":"what is a Hedge Ghost? Are they people that died in the Hedge?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4045-princeofcincinnati","name":"princeofcincinnati","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T10:45:38-07:00","id":1085499,"title":"","content":"New concept from the &quot;A Walk In The Hedge&quot; preview. Will give Link when back at computer","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a hr